# Deployment isolation + upload hygiene for `railway up audiogen --path-as-root`.
# See backend/.railwayignore for the rationale.
#
# src/samples/ is ~210 MB of character voice-clone REFERENCE audio, needed
# only by the local `voices:register` / `trim:samples` tooling — never by the
# deployed /health + narration service. Excluding it here is what fixes the
# upload timeout hit during the first rollout (the repo-root .gitignore rule
# `audiogen/src/samples/` did NOT apply once the archive was re-rooted to
# audiogen/). If you ever run `voices:register` in CI, do it from a checkout,
# not from a Railway deploy.
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
src/samples/
